@ HAMZA, the rival (replaces May and Brendan). He lives next door and helps PROF. MO. He loves
@ talking about gimmicks (MEGA EVOLUTION, G-MOVES…), beefs with your dad HISHAM (who adores him
@ anyway), and ends every conversation running off with the same line.
@ Two labels in a row get the same text: the May and Brendan versions of a scene.

@@ file: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc
RivalsHouse_1F_Text_OhYoureTheNewNeighbor:
	.string "Oh, hello. And you are?\p"
	.string "… … … … … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … … … … …\p"
	.string "Oh, you're {PLAYER}, our new\n"
	.string "next-door neighbor! Hi!\p"
	.string "Our HAMZA is about the same\n"
	.string "age as you.\p"
	.string "He's been talking about MEGA\n"
	.string "EVOLUTION all morning.\p"
	.string "He's upstairs, I think.$"

RivalsHouse_1F_Text_LikeChildLikeFather:
	.string "HAMZA is wild about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Well, about POKéMON gimmicks.\n"
	.string "MEGA this, G-MOVE that.\p"
	.string "If he's not upstairs, he's at\n"
	.string "the LAB, bothering PROF. MO.$"

RivalsHouse_1F_Text_TooBusyToNoticeVisit:
	.string "That HAMZA!\p"
	.string "I guess he's too busy reading about\n"
	.string "gimmicks to notice you came to\l"
	.string "visit, {PLAYER}.$"

RivalsHouse_1F_Text_WentOutToRoute103:
	.string "Oh, HAMZA went out to ROUTE 103\n"
	.string "just a little while ago.\p"
	.string "Something about a new gimmick.\n"
	.string "He can't stay quietly at home.$"

RivalsHouse_1F_Text_MayWhoAreYou:
RivalsHouse_1F_Text_BrendanWhoAreYou:
	.string "Huh?\n"
	.string "Who are you?\p"
	.string "Oh, you're {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You moved in next door.\p"
	.string "I'm HAMZA. I help PROF. MO\n"
	.string "with his research.\p"
	.string "Do you know about MEGA EVOLUTION?\n"
	.string "Z-MOVES? DYNAMAX? TERASTAL?\p"
	.string "Every generation gets a new gimmick.\n"
	.string "It's the best part of POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Your dad HISHAM says gimmicks are\n"
	.string "cheating. HISHAM is wrong.\p"
	.string "Tell him I said so.\p"
	.string "Oh, no! I'm supposed to help\n"
	.string "PROF. MO catch wild POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I'm not taking my sneakers off!\n"
	.string "I am SNEAKERS O'TOOLE!$"

