	.string "you. That's a gimmick by itself.\p"
	.string "HISHAM's kid, huh? He's going to\n"
	.string "say I lost on purpose. I didn't!\p"
	.string "Let's head back to the LAB.\p"
	.string "I'm not taking my sneakers off!\n"
	.string "I am SNEAKERS O'TOOLE!$"

